READING: ESS/B ~ exp(-N*delta). If -log(ESS/B)/N is ~constant across N, the per-particle KL gap delta is size-invariant and the weight ESS decays EXACTLY exponentially in N -> the flow LIKELIHOOD (as IS weights) is cursed at scale, even though its SAMPLES transfer flat.
